[EnabledPathSwapConnectivity.result](../../../D5/S3/ConceptDynamics/PartialIdentification/EnabledPathSwapConnectivity.lean),
with its [owning Scribe](../../../Blueprint/D5/S3/ConceptDynamics/PartialIdentification/EnabledPathSwapConnectivity.scribe.cs),
already supply the finite-order exchange principle. The proof above
checks the extra actual zero-write/material correspondence and the
source-specific iff criterion. The criterion classifies one-Tick
positivity, not all methods or domains of history recovery.

